// leans in. Scrolling: it reads along, turned and slid to the Mac, lower, its eyes down on the page,
// travelling down a line and snapping back up with a nod; two minutes on, settled in, lids half down;
// with the screen above it, up at it. Typing fast: hunched in, eyes wide, paws quicker; a long stretch of
// typing stopped, a look up at you. Music: half-closed eyes and a sway, then a rest, then a look round
// as it stops. A video: turned to the screen, taller, eyes wide, and a small start now and then. A call:
// still, smaller, eyes half; a stretch as it ends. A copy: puffed up round; let go, a pah.
